### Follow a feed through a like, a restart and a sign-out

<figure class="stepper" data-illustrated><span class="stepper-title">The list reads Room; everything else writes to it</span><div class="stage viz-stack"><div class="viz-grid" data-cols="3"><div class="node" data-el="ui" data-art="screen" data-art-role="client"><strong>Feed list</strong><small data-text="uiV">LazyColumn</small></div><div class="node" data-el="pager" data-art="code" data-art-role="runtime"><strong>Pager</strong><small data-text="pagerV">reads Room</small></div><div class="node" data-el="room" data-art="database" data-art-role="storage"><strong>Room</strong><small data-text="roomV">this account’s rows</small></div></div><div class="viz-grid" data-cols="3"><div class="node" data-el="mediator" data-art="worker" data-art-role="queue"><strong>RemoteMediator</strong><small data-text="mediatorV">idle</small></div><div class="node" data-el="api" data-art="server" data-art-role="runtime"><strong>Feed API</strong><small data-text="apiV">GET /v1/feed</small></div><div class="node" data-el="outbox" data-art="queue" data-art-role="queue"><strong>Engagement outbox</strong><small data-text="outboxV">empty</small></div></div><div class="viz-grid" data-cols="2"><div class="node" data-el="players" data-art="memory" data-art-role="runtime"><strong>Player pool</strong><small data-text="playersV">2–3 players</small></div><div class="node" data-el="hint" data-art="signal" data-art-role="runtime"><strong>FCM hint</strong><small data-text="hintV">none</small></div></div><div class="node is-key" data-el="event" data-art="signal" data-art-role="runtime"><strong>What happens</strong><small data-text="eventV">—</small></div></div><script type="application/json" class="steps">[
  {
    "label": "initialize() checks the cache",
